      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hey! I'd be happy to help you draft that performance review. You can definitely frame the positive aspects about client retention and hitting targets as a solid foundation, while gently addressing the punctuality issue for the morning stand-ups as an area for growth.\n\nHere is a draft you can use:\n\n\"Great work on the quarterly results, [Name]. Your ability to retain key clients and consistently hit retention targets has been exceptional this quarter. It's clear you have a strong grasp of our client needs and a talent for keeping them engaged.\n\nHowever, to take this performance to the next level, we need to focus on your attendance at the morning stand-up meetings. While your output is top-tier, being more punctual will help you integrate more effectively into our daily workflow and ensure you're fully aligned with the team from the start of the day. Let's work on establishing a stricter routine for these meetings so you can maintain your high standards in both client relations and team collaboration.\"\n\nLet me know if you'd like to adjust the tone or add any specific metrics!",
